WEBVTT

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:05.480
<i>I might not be able to 
do anything on my own.</i>

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:06.650
<i>But...</i>

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:16.740
Live Coverage

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:16.740
Nagataki City

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:16.740
Mysterious Fire Erupts at Fortune-Telling School; 
Possibility of Riots too

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.890
<i>The building is burning even now 
due to the mysterious fire.</i>

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:19.440
<i>According to witnesses,</i>

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.910
<i>a riot had broken out, and the 
police and fire department</i>

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:25.010
Isn't that the school that 
Akari and her friends go to?

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:25.010
<i>are currently investigating 
the cause of the fire.</i>

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:27.400
This definitely doesn't look good.

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:36.510
Auntie, help...

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:37.990
Akari!

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:18.110
<b>Your Path</b>

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:22.620
Maybe we should take 
them to the hospital?

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:25.900
It's probably better if 
they don't go outside yet.

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:26.620
True.

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:29.420
Why did this happen?

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:32.440
<i>The number you are trying to reach</i>

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:36.470
<i>is out of the service area or turned off...</i>

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:39.520
You still can't get a hold of her?

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:42.750
Yeah. I wonder where Seira went.

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:44.380
She couldn't handle the 
situation, and ran.

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:48.340
Seira currently doesn't 
have her elemental powers.

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:50.300
She'd just be baggage 
to the organization.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:53.020
She probably couldn't live with 
herself being in that state.

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:55.010
How could you say that?

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:57.530
I'm going to look for her...

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.530
Let us wait until morning.

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:01.620
But...

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:04.280
It's best that we don't move just yet.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:08.790
We can't be certain that 
we weren't followed.

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:32.940
Well, this is unexpected.

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:36.840
I'd totally thought it'd 
be Akari who'd come.

00:03:38.890 --> 00:03:39.900
Who are you?

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:42.950
There are some humans 
who call me Cerebrum.

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:46.950
She did a lot more than 
I expected her to.

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:48.670
Luna, that is.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:54.210
She even stole your powers.

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:56.690
Return Luna to normal.

00:03:57.140 --> 00:03:59.250
Yeah, that's not going to happen.

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:03.790
Not to mention, it's not 
like I'm controlling her.

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:07.220
It's because of her own 
emotional problem.

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:12.530
Luna stole your powers 
through her own will.

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:13.880
What do you mean?

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:17.230
Are you going to tell me 
you really didn't know?

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.230
You all really must have 
been playing friends.

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:26.490
Luna wanted you to 
disappear this whole time.

00:04:43.270 --> 00:04:46.910
I heard that you were 
Hinata's teacher.

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:55.290
I'm sorry that you're 
taking care of us,

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:57.050
yet I cannot explain everything.

00:04:57.050 --> 00:04:59.910
Well, there are a lot 
of things in the world

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:01.810
I'm better off not knowing.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.840
How was Hinata?

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:05.530
Huh?

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:08.150
Was she happy?

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:10.710
Well...

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:14.420
I think the only person who 
knew that was Hinata herself.

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:16.480
I'm assuming there were

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:18.900
happy times and hard times for her,

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:20.540
though that's just stating the obvious.

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:24.910
By the time she got here,

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:28.050
she knew that she was going to die soon,

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:31.530
so she always asked that I 
look after Akari for her.

00:05:33.050 --> 00:05:37.060
I had gotten the idea that Akari was 
different from other children.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:41.780
So we didn't mind taking care 
of her in Hinata's place.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:43.570
I'm sorry.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:50.460
You raised her with such care, 
and something like this happened...

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:55.080
I don't know what Akari is doing, 
but that can't be helped.

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:58.580
That's just another part 
of her destiny, isn't it?

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:02.340
Things to be gained, things 
that must be thrown away...

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:06.360
She'll probably have a lot more decisions 
she'll have to make in the future,

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:11.000
but I hope she'll follow 
the path that she believes in.

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:22.110
Is something the matter?

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:25.350
I should have told her sooner.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:29.590
Even though it was an 
order from the Leguzario,

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:34.280
in reality, you should be the one 
in charge of your own destiny.

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:36.620
I've done something unforgivable.

00:06:37.550 --> 00:06:40.020
Then I'm just as guilty as you are.

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:43.380
I will stick with you.

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:52.640
Shall I repeat myself?

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:55.750
Luna wants you to disappear.

00:06:56.230 --> 00:06:57.650
She's jealous of you.

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:01.650
Luna loves Akari.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:05.330
And your existence gets in the 
way of their relationship.

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:09.150
She was scared that you might 
steal Akari away from her.

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:11.980
Every time you and Akari got closer,

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:15.410
she thought that Akari 
might pick you over her.

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:17.180
But...

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:18.910
There are a lot of malicious feelings,

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:22.240
but jealousy is the easiest 
emotion to deal with.

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:24.920
It's definitely the 
easiest to manipulate.

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:28.520
The feeling of guilt toward 
another, complexes,

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:30.420
an emotion you don't want 
to be brought to light...

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:33.530
You probably don't understand,

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:36.570
considering you've 
probably never felt it.

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:39.930
I mean, you've been 
cutting them out, right?

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:43.940
Other people, and the 
evil in your own heart.

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:46.440
What are you trying to say?

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:50.560
I'm praising your sense of 
justice and heartlessness.

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:53.950
You're hard on others, 
as well as yourself.

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:57.560
Compared to that, Luna's 
so weak, isn't she?

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:00.700
You can't forgive that weakness.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:02.640
Right?

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:04.150
That's not...

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:05.630
You don't have to sugarcoat things.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:08.140
It's because of that weakness

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:11.690
that you lost the thing 
most precious to you.

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:15.400
Your powers.

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:18.060
Your elemental powers.

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:20.790
Man, I'm hated.

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:24.230
And I was just going to tell 
you something good, too.

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.170
You can get your powers back

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:28.900
with this.

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:33.100
I'm saying that if Luna dies, 
your powers will return.

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:34.310
Easy, right?

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:35.820
You...

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:38.950
Luna's not going to return to normal.

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:42.010
Wouldn't it be better 
for you to kill her

00:08:42.010 --> 00:08:45.430
instead of having her 
live life as a wolf girl?

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:49.240
You're frustrated, aren't you?

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:50.890
About the fact that 
you can't do anything.

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:55.490
It wouldn't be fair to Akari to 
make her keep fighting on her own.

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:58.930
Well, I'm actually okay 
with either option.

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:02.070
You only have a few hours 
to make your move.

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:04.470
If the medicine wears 
off, she'll wake up.

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:25.870
<i>It wouldn't be fair to Akari to 
make her keep fighting on her own.</i>

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:28.480
<i>It's because of that weakness</i>

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:32.140
<i>that you lost the thing 
most precious to you.</i>

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:36.380
<i>The thing most precious to me...</i>

00:09:57.810 --> 00:10:00.370
Morning. Breakfast is ready.

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:10.380
The bread you bake is 
always delicious, Lymro.

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:13.800
Isn't it? It's been a while 
since I went all out.

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:18.410
Come on, have some minestrone. 
It's full of nutrients!

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:19.640
Come on! Come on!

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:19.640
Th-Thanks...

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:23.130
You need to eat a lot to 
regain your strength.

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:24.620
Yeah...

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:28.390
Any word on Seira?

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:30.900
We still haven't found her.

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:33.880
I'm going to...

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:35.030
Nope.

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:38.070
It's better that you don't leave yet.

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:41.410
Akari-oneetan, it's best that 
you don't do that.

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:45.120
Yes. We'll go look for her later.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.190
So don't worry, please.

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:55.420
<i>Wouldn't it be better for 
you to kill her?</i>

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:59.430
<i>At this rate, no one will be saved.</i>

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:03.920
<i>People who become Daemonia are weak.</i>

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:04.880
<i>The</i>

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:09.020
<i>only thing I can do is fight!</i>

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:20.110
No!

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:26.640
No, no! The thing most 
precious to me is...

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:31.830
It doesn't look like anyone's here.

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:35.340
And I even prepared security 
equipment, too.

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:38.340
This is pretty bad.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:41.340
This is fine.

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:43.170
Thank you.

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:44.430
You.

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:49.550
Be careful! If anything happens, call us.

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:51.350
I'll bring by some snacks later.

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:52.850
Okay!

00:11:57.950 --> 00:12:00.630
<i>What's going to happen now?</i>

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:02.590
Akari-san.

00:12:02.590 --> 00:12:04.010
Do you have a moment?

00:12:05.230 --> 00:12:07.020
I have something important to tell you.

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:10.520
To tell me?

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:13.210
It has to do with your birth.

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:14.060
Huh?

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:16.050
Wait, what are you saying?

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:18.960
I'm only going to tell her 
what needs to be told.

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:21.070
What are you talking about?

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:22.940
That is top-secret information!

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:24.970
That will mean defying 
the Leguzario!

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:27.400
Are you prepared for that?

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:29.220
I believe that I am.

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:30.530
What?

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:30.530
Oh?

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:35.180
This situation always 
involved Akari-san's life.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.980
She has every right to know.

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:45.110
It is wrong for someone's life to 
be controlled by an organization.

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:48.220
She should be able to 
make her own destiny.

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:48.990
Nonsense!

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:52.430
One's destiny is already decided!

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:53.720
Cause and effect are ruled by

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:55.870
the principle of causality!

00:12:56.320 --> 00:13:00.550
Then why is the Leguzario 
purposely abandoning us?

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:05.130
While our comrades were being 
hurt and losing their lives,

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:07.290
you did nothing!

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:09.880
I'm done with being used

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:12.730
and having all of our 
feelings stomped on.

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:14.230
You fool.

00:13:14.740 --> 00:13:16.580
I will be reporting all of this.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:18.530
Let us go, Schrödinger.

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:19.730
This is interesting, meow.

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:21.060
What?

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:24.280
Laplace, my opinion of destiny 
is different from yours, meow.

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:27.240
You won't know what's inside the 
box until you open it, meow.

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:28.670
You...

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:31.470
I'm going to stay here as 
a familiar, meow,

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:34.250
and watch how they 
decide their destiny, meow.

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:37.920
Do as you wish.

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:42.500
Well, then...

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:45.510
Let the top-secret information 
be revealed, meow.

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:55.250
Thank goodness it's not broken.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:57.770
We can find the location of the 
Inquiry Card with this, too.

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:06.280
Seira-oneetan, where are you?

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:12.280
She'll be hard to find from the 
Astralux side, but let's do what we can.

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:31.600
What I'm about to tell you will 
probably be very hard for you.

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:36.150
Your mother, Taiyo Hinata,

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:40.520
fought alongside us as a tarot 
card user of Sefiro Fiore.

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:53.620
Just like you, she was a very cheerful

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:57.120
and kind person who always 
thought of others.

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:01.530
One day,

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:05.270
she fell in love with a 
man who was studying the

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:08.490
Daemonia in a research facility 
directly controlled by the Leguzario.

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:14.890
But that man was infected by the 
Daemonia during his research.

00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:18.430
He disappeared.

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:21.730
We're still unaware of his whereabouts,

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:23.420
but it's likely that the Leguzario...

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:29.250
It was right after that we learned 
that Hinata was with child.

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:33.410
That was you.

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:39.410
You were born from a 
Daemonia and a tarot card user.

00:15:40.360 --> 00:15:45.670
The Elemental Tarot and Diabolos Tarot 
were originally one tarot, meow.

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:49.600
It's possible that you 
possess powers from both.

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:56.180
The fact that you can hear the voices 
of the Daemonia is only natural.

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:59.350
I'm a Daemonia's...

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:02.440
The Leguzario had foreseen 
your awakening.

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:07.780
We were ordered to bring you into 
the organization to protect you.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:11.950
I thought about whether I should 
tell you this or not many times.

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:15.130
You may have been happier not knowing.

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:16.570
I even considered that.

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:20.330
But I'm not the one 
who should decide.

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:27.090
It may be too late now, but I 
wanted you to know the truth.

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:29.470
Even if it's hard and painful,

00:16:29.470 --> 00:16:31.470
I want you to decide your 
destiny on your own.

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:33.190
Etia-san...

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:34.970
I don't really want to say this,

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:38.470
but you have the right to 
side with the Daemonia.

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:41.870
The Daemonia with free will,

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:45.530
Cerebrum, is after Akari, meow.

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:47.480
He wants her to join him.

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:49.440
Of course we believe in you.

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:53.970
But if you were to decide 
that, we could not stop you.

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:58.270
Cerebrum will definitely 
try to contact you.

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:02.780
Did it already happen?

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:05.100
I think it might have.

00:17:06.280 --> 00:17:09.630
The one who made Luna-chan 
and Seira like that

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:11.460
is Cerebrum, right?

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:13.480
We believe so.

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:18.470
Then I might be able to save them.

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:21.060
It's too dangerous!

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:23.060
I said it was your choice,

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:25.190
but you don't have to step 
right into the enemy's trap—

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:27.920
But there's no other choice.

00:17:29.050 --> 00:17:32.170
I don't know what 
Cerebrum wants from me,

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:36.490
or what it means for
 me to join him, but...

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:41.990
Watching everyone become a victim, 
one after another...

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:44.080
It's just too painful.

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:50.130
Those two made a bold choice.

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:53.430
I apologize that I couldn't 
continue my surveillance.

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:55.220
No, this is interesting.

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:58.520
That's why Schrödinger 
stayed behind, is it not?

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:02.390
We always disagreed on 
the subject of destiny.

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:06.640
Your relationship is 
rather fascinating.

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:11.220
It appears that I've 
upset Cerebrum because

00:18:11.220 --> 00:18:14.060
I scolded him the other day.

00:18:14.060 --> 00:18:16.570
Something important was stolen.

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:17.660
Something important?

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:20.400
Depending on how things play out,

00:18:20.400 --> 00:18:23.490
I may have to ask you 
to do something for me.

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:24.240
Understood.

00:18:35.950 --> 00:18:37.540
Oh, Onee-chan!

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:43.850
Your mommy is sleeping here, right?

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:45.430
So I gave her a flower.

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:49.860
Hey, let's talk again today.

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:52.940
I wanted to talk to you, too,

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.200
about your real self.

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:58.910
I'm surprised you found me out.

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:03.200
It looks like you know everything now.

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:06.150
You're after me, right?

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:09.400
Turn Luna-chan and 
Seira back to normal.

00:19:11.140 --> 00:19:14.710
If you're after me, those two 
have nothing to do with this.

00:19:15.110 --> 00:19:17.250
Tell me what I need to do.

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:19.260
I expected nothing less.

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:22.720
You're quite amazing.

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:25.820
You won't even think twice

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:28.480
about sacrificing yourself 
for your friends.

00:19:28.970 --> 00:19:33.480
Truly magnificent, and you don't 
even realize that that's hypocrisy.

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:38.700
Your sense of justice is strong, 
you're bright like the sun,

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:41.490
and you're nice to everyone.

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:43.990
That's probably what draws them in.

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:45.490
The humans.

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:51.780
You're very strong, considering 
half of you is one of us.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:55.750
You don't seem to have 
a bit of evil in you.

00:19:57.610 --> 00:20:05.010
But you don't think that attitude 
of yours hurts others, do you?

00:20:06.070 --> 00:20:08.520
So innocent. Always smiling.

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:13.700
So bright. Humans can't 
exist next to the sun.

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:15.810
The more the sun shines bright,

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:17.520
the darker the shadow becomes.

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:21.030
I think that's what they couldn't 
stand about you anymore.

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:23.780
Fu-yu-na, too.

00:20:34.590 --> 00:20:35.970
I think it's about time...

00:20:57.140 --> 00:20:57.980
No!

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:21.760
I'll grant your wish for you.

00:21:22.030 --> 00:21:24.380
I'll save Luna and Seira.

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:26.260
If you come with me.

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:27.790
Really?

00:21:27.790 --> 00:21:29.760
Yes. If you come with me,

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:32.860
you may even be able to 
find out why Fuyuna turned

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:35.020
into a Daemonia and attacked you.

00:21:35.470 --> 00:21:38.520
But you'll never be able 
to come back here.

00:21:39.870 --> 00:21:42.990
You may never be able 
to see Luna and Seira

00:21:42.990 --> 00:21:45.030
after working so hard to save them.

00:21:46.100 --> 00:21:49.530
Or your other friends, the people 
who took care of you, everyone...

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:54.980
Will you come even then?

00:22:10.170 --> 00:22:11.310
Well?

00:22:13.590 --> 00:22:14.690
What will it be?

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:30.000
<b>Right after their deaths, the dead souls are 
 revived by an angel blowing a trumpet.</b>

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:42.190
<b>#20  Judgment</b>

00:23:27.200 --> 00:23:29.660
I want to try the shrimp toast 
that Nagataki is famous for!

00:23:29.660 --> 00:23:30.850
What's it like?

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:33.070
<b>They are then judged on their actions 
while they were alive. It is said that
 some will be lead to the land of God, 
and others will fall into Hell.</b>

00:23:30.850 --> 00:23:32.620
It's fluffy, crunchy, and juicy.

00:23:32.620 --> 00:23:33.690
Yes, yes, and?

00:23:33.070 --> 00:23:36.160
<b>The Judgment card shows that if you 
keep on doing good deeds and never 
lose hope, you are guaranteed to be 
rewarded with good fortune.</b>

00:23:33.690 --> 00:23:35.370
You're filled with happiness 
when you eat it,

00:23:35.370 --> 00:23:37.790
and filled with even more happiness 
when you drink tea after you eat it.

00:23:36.160 --> 00:23:39.660
<b>If you were to choose this card, 
all of your past efforts and endeavors 
will be rewarded, and it shows that your 
life will change in the right direction.</b>

00:23:37.790 --> 00:23:39.420
That doesn't explain anything!

00:23:37.890 --> 00:23:41.390
<b>Choosing Your Destiny</b>

00:23:39.420 --> 00:23:40.980
See you next time!

00:23:39.660 --> 00:23:42.230
<b>However if the card is reversed, 
it will be an unexpectedly bad result, 
making you think "I should have tried a 
little harder," and filling you with regret.</b>
